Z||000007||AutoXdbdragSE||10-12-2001||12:58 AM||||Actually i think if saturn did get the opel that would be sweet.. imagine the fivspeed and engine from an sc2 in their..  200hp.. 5speed.. fun fun fun.. and saturn prides it self on low cost so i think it would be probably outsell our beloved fiero if it sticks around.. i mean who wouldn't want it it would be cheap.. very very fun.. and dead saturn reliable.. also if they used the saturn engine it would have very very good factory backing for racing and performance parts.. all in all a win win situation.. it would also increase midengined coolness world wide.  I always thought saturn would be a beter company to reintroduce a fiero type substitute. because if it was pontiac again it would end up with caviler runing gear.. i mean who really want's caviler runing gear??  i higly doubt if pontac got it it would ever get the 3800 sc.. because.. 2300lb car.. 250hp.. good by vette..||||reg||1
